      "authors": [
        "Reyna Abhyankar",
        "Dylan Lim",
        "Simran Arora"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand why hand-tuning dynamic AI inference workloads across fragmented hardware and architectures is failing, and how continual compilation provides an automated optimization loop.",
