      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "authors": [
        "benkelaya"
      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how Triton Gluon reaches Volta tensor cores directly using linear layouts without scalar FMA fallback. You will gain a clear pattern for configuring m8n8k4 matrix operations on legacy hardware.",
